]] [[time]], [[no]] [[mirror]] [[was|be]] [[in]] [[danger]].`,`vn`:`Nh\u1ea1c n\u1ed5i l\u00ean. Th\u1eafm chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc, t\u1eebng \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00e1c u\u1ed1n l\u01b0\u1ee3n nh\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ch\u1ea3y. R\u1ed3i c\u1ea3 ba t\u00e1ch ra, m\u1ed7i ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\u1ec1 m\u1ed9t g\u00f3c, v\u00e0 quay l\u1ea1i b\u00ean nhau v\u00e0o \u0111\u00fang c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc. B\u01a1 nh\u1edb ph\u1ea3i khu\u1ef5u g\u1ed1i, r\u1ed3i \u0111\u00e1 ch\u00e2n th\u1eadt cao. \u0110\u1ebfn \u0111o\u1ea1n k\u1ebft, hai c\u1eadu con trai \u0111\u1ee1 l\u1ea5y Th\u1eafm v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng c\u00f4 l\u00ean cao. L\u1ea7n n\u00e0y, ch\u1eb3ng c\u00f3 c\u00e1i g\u01b0\u01a1ng n\u00e0o g\u1eb7p nguy.`},{`en`:`[[When]] [[the]] [[music]] [[stopped|stop]], [[they]] [[remained|remain]] [[on]] [[the]] [[floor]], [[breathing]] [[hard]]. [[People]] [[shouted|shout]] [[and]] [[waved|wave]]. Tham [[waved|wave]] [[back]]. \`[[Did|do]] [[I]] [[fall]]?\` Bo [[asked|ask]]. \`[[No]],\` [[said|say]] Tuan. \`[[You]] [[danced|dance]].\``,`vn`:`Nh\u1ea1c t\u1eaft, c\u1ea3 ba v\u1eabn n\u1eb1m l\u1ea1i tr\u00ean s\u00e0n, th\u1edf h\u1ed5n h\u1ec3n. M\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi reo h\u00f2, v\u1eaby tay. Th\u1eafm v\u1eaby tay \u0111\u00e1p l\u1ea1i. \`Em c\u00f3 ng\u00e3 kh\u00f4ng?\` B\u01a1 h\u1ecfi. \`Kh\u00f4ng,\` Tu\u1ea5n n\u00f3i. \`Em nh\u1ea3y th\u1eadt r\u1ed3i.\``},{`en`:`[[The]] [[judges|judge]] [[acted|act]] [[quickly]], [[and]] [[at]] [[twelve]] [[a]] [[man]] [[read]] [[the]] [[results|result]]. \`[[In]] [[fourth]] [[place]]...\` Bo [[could]] [[not]] [[look]], [[so]] [[he]] [[closed|close]] [[his]] [[eyes|eye]] [[tight]]. \`[[Team]] [[nine]]!\` Bo [[jumped|jump]] [[so]] [[high]] [[that]] [[he]] [[almost]] [[hit]] [[the]] [[ceiling]]. [[They]] [[had|have]] [[stuck|stick]] [[together]], [[and]] [[it]] [[had|have]] [[worked|work]].`,`vn`:`Ban gi\u00e1m kh\u1ea3o l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c r\u1ea5t nhanh, v\u00e0 m\u01b0\u1eddi hai gi\u1edd, m\u1ed9